## Title: Tea And Toast
## Description: Nan keeps an eye on inactivity, heckles you in PvP, and now provides live fishing banter for casts, catches, and missed reel-ins. All chat is identified as [Nan Says] for VCAP2 filtering. Console-safe and standalone.
